# check-no-goatnet-defaults.sh exemptions. One `roles/<role>/defaults/main.yml:<variable>`
# per line. Shrink-only: a listed default that stops naming a goatnet is refused
# until its line is removed. Add a line only with the reason in the role's own
# comment; these two carry it (the provisioning tier is a shared
# cross-goatnet service).
ops/ansible/roles/goat-docs/defaults/main.yml:goat_docs_mirror_base
ops/ansible/roles/goat-get/defaults/main.yml:goat_get_mirror_base
